00:52:29.230 --> 00:52:33.670
And I just wondered, was that he had been drinking some Fiji water and it ended up in

1213
00:52:33.670 --> 00:52:36.250
the scene and he turned, because, you know, was he, I don't know.

1214
00:52:36.250 --> 00:52:42.790
I just, it stood out to me, but it also stood out to me because earlier in the week, by

1215
00:52:42.790 --> 00:52:48.590
coincidence, my family became fascinated with the origins of bottled water.

1216
00:52:48.890 --> 00:52:53.330
So we're in this phase right now where our 10-year-old, if we're talking at dinner and

1217
00:52:53.330 --> 00:52:57.130
we bring up something, he wants to look it up and find out everything about it.

